    "escape_room_cipher_input": "Koma eyano ya code oyo ofungoli. Talela bonkomi malamu.",
    "escape_room_cipher_submit": "Submit yo decrypted eyano na unlock oyo lock.",
    "escape_room_fillin_input": "Type missing maloba na silisá fraze.",
    "escape_room_fillin_submit": "Submit yo eyano na fill na blank.",
