    "header_language": "Pona monoko ya UI (babutons, ba labels, ba menu). Ezali ya ndenge mosusu na monoko ya mateya.",
    "header_session_start": "Esalaka code ya session oyo bayekoli bakoki kokota mpe bakomi ba elements ya solo.",
    "header_session_join": "moyekoli: Kotisá 6-digit code uta yo molakisi na connect. yo work will sync na molakisi's dashboard na ngonga ya solo.",
