    "wizard_std_manual_input": "Kotisá mibeko code manually (e.g., 'CCSS.ELA-LITERACY.RI.5.1').",
    "wizard_std_mode_ai": "Salelá AI na automatically koyeba relevant mibeko uta yo mateya.",
