      "myth35_2_why": "Kaka eteni ya likolo-nse ya motion etɛlɛmaka na peak. Bale ekobaka koningana liboso ntango nyonso.",
      "myth35_2_tryit": "Funga Vectors mpe talá horizontal arrow na peak ya arc — ekitaka soki moke te.",
      "myth35_3_s": "Kobakisa launch speed mbala mibale ebakisaka distance mbala mibale.",
      "myth35_3_why": "Distance ekolaka lokola speed × speed. Bakisa speed mbala mibale, ekokita mosika mbala MINEI.",
      "myth35_3_tryit": "Bwaka na 15 m/s, na sima na 30 m/s na angle moko — kokanisa landing marks.",
      "myth35_4_s": "Kotala na 45° ebwakaka mosika koleka (kozanga mopɛpɛ).",
      "myth35_4_why": "Low angles epumbwaka patatalu kasi ekweyaka noki mingi; high angles ebebisaka speed na komata. 45° ezali boyokani ya kokoka.",
      "myth35_4_tryit": "Sala complementary-angle demo — 30° na 60° ekitaka ata na esika moko.",
      "myth68_1_s": "Nsima ya launch, force ekobaka kotinda bale liboso.",
      "myth68_1_why": "Ntango kaka etiki cannon, force KAKA moko ezali gravity oyo ebɛndaka na nse semba. Forward motion ekobaka mpo ntina moko etɛlɛmisaka yango te — Newton's first law.",
      "myth68_1_tryit": "Talá vector overlay ntango ezali kopumbwa: forward force ezali te, kasi Vx etikalaka kokangama mpenza.",
      "myth68_2_s": "Bale oyo babwaki horizontal mpe bale oyo batiki na height moko ekomaka na mabelé na ntango moko.",
      "myth68_2_why": "Horizontal na vertical motion ezali ya bango moko. Bale nyonso mibale ekweyaka na gravity moko uta na height moko, yango wana ekitaka esika moko.",
      "myth68_2_tryit": "Bwaka na angle ya nse mingi mpe kokanisa flight time na bwakani mokuse ya likolo uta na height moko.",
      "myth912_1_s": "Na Air Drag Efungwami, 45° ezali kaka angle ya malamu koleka.",
      "myth912_1_why": "Drag epesaka etumbu na mipumbwe milai ya likolo — eliaka v² na nzela mobimba. Optimum ekitaka tii pene na 30-40° na kotala speed.",
      "myth912_1_tryit": "Funga air drag mpe leka angle slider — talá esika landing mark ekómaka peak ya solo.",
