      "per_grade_skills_checklists_use_during": "Ba-liste ya makoki na kelasi nyonso. Salela na ntango ya komeka moto-na-moto to mpo na kobongisa boteyi.",
      "my_child_says_i_hate_fractions": "Mwana na ngai alobaka \"Nayinaka biteni\"",
      "very_common_fractions_break_the_rules_": "Emonanaka mingi. Biteni ebukaka mibeko oyo bayekoli bayekolaka mpo na mitango mobimba — mitango minene elimboli te ntango nyonso ba-valeur minene. Nkanda ezali ya solo mpe ya momeseno. Salisa na: (1) kosalela ba-modèle ya emonaneli lokola pizza to mikaba ya eteni, (2) kokangisa na bomoi ya solo (bolambi, ntango, mbongo), (3) kosala momesano moke mpe mbala mingi (miniti 5 na mokolo) na esika ya session ya molai, (4) kokumisa milende, kaka biyano ya solo te.",
      "my_child_doesn_t_understand_why_proced": "Mwana na ngai asosolaka te NTINA misala esalaka",
      "they_are_not_alone_most_students_learn": "Bazali bango moko te — bayekoli mingi bayekolaka mosala liboso mpe ntina na sima. Salisa na kolakisa ntango nyonso ndenge mosala emonanaka na elilingi. \"Fula 3/4 na 1/2\" ekoki kosalema lokola rectangle. Tab ya Op Proofs esalaka yango mpo na yo. Tuna \"mpo na nini?\" na boboto mpe mbala mingi.",
      "how_can_i_help_with_homework_without_d": "Ndenge nini nakoki kosalisa na mosala ya ndako kozanga kosala yango mpo na bango?",
      "use_the_worked_examples_tab_they_show_": "Salela tab ya Worked Examples — elakisaka misala litambe na litambe na makanisi. Leka na mikakatano oyo ekokani elongo, oyo kaka moko te. Soki balobi \"Nayebi te ndenge ya kobanda,\" tuna \"Mokakatano esengaka nini oluka? Nini toyebi déjà?\" Système ya bilembeteli na Mikakatano ya Maloba epesaka bilembeteli na ba-couche — meka ya liboso liboso ya eyano.",
      "what_should_i_drill": "Nini nasengeli kosala momesano?",
      "ies_practice_guide_recommends_1_magnit": "IES Practice Guide epesaka toli: (1) makanisi ya monene (mosala ya molɔngɔ ya motango), (2) bokangani kati na emonaneli mpe elembo, (3) mikakatano ya maloba na likambo. BOYA: momesano na misala kozanga bososoli. Lekisa miniti 5 na Benchmark Trainer, 5 na Mikakatano ya Maloba, mpe 5 na lisano — yango ezali session ya miniti 15 ya malamu.",
      "my_child_gets_the_procedure_right_but_": "Mwana na ngai asalaka mosala malamu kasi eyano ezali mabe",
      "usually_means_a_small_arithmetic_error": "Mbala mingi elimboli libunga moke ya arithmétique (ndakisa, afuli mabe) to apɛtoli te. Lakisa bango Cheat Sheet — bakoki kotala mosala na bango litambe na litambe. Lendisa bango kondimisa na lolenge mosusu (kanisa liboso, to salela modèle mosusu).",
      "what_if_i_don_t_remember_fractions_wel": "Soki ngai moko nayebi biteni malamu te?",
      "you_don_t_have_to_be_the_expert_use_th": "Osengeli te kozala expert! Salela Tab Guide mpe Worked Examples — elimbolaka misala polele. Oyo eleki malamu: lakisa \"tóluka oyo elongo.\" Okoki koyekola elongo na mwana na yo. Tab ya Maloba ezali na tina ata mpo na bakóló.",
      "how_do_i_know_if_my_child_is_on_track": "Ndenge nini nayebi soki mwana na ngai azali na nzela?",
      "look_at_the_standards_tab_to_see_which": "Tala tab ya Standards mpo na komona ba-norme CCSS oyo basengeli koyeba mpo na kelasi na bango. Tab ya Mastery elakisaka bokoli. Mpo na botali ya nokinoki: bakoki (a) kosala modèle mpo na 3/4, (b) koloba eteni ekokani na 1/2, (c) kokanisa 2/3 mpe 3/4 mpe kolimbola? Ba-test misato wana ezipaka bilikya mingi ya eteni ya K-5.",
      "parent_guide": "👨‍👩‍👧 Guide ya baboti",
      "guidance_for_parents_helping_kids_with": "Litambwisi mpo na baboti oyo basalisaka bana na biteni na ndako. Mikakatano ya momeseno, batoli ya solo, mpe nini kotuna.",
      "the_why_of_learning_recruiting_interes": "\"NTINA\" ya boyekoli — kobenda mposa, kosimba milende, bomikambi",
