      "the_1_2_trick": "Mayele ya 1/2",
      "let_your_number_be_n_the_sequence_n_1_": "Tika motango na yo ezala n. Molongo: (n+1) × 2 + 4 − 6 = 2n + 2 + 4 − 6 = 2n. Kabola na 2 → n. Longola ebandeli → 0. Zela — yango epesaka 0, 1 te. Meka: n → (n+1)×2 = 2n+2 → +4 = 2n+6 → −6 = 2n → ÷2 = n → −ebandeli = 0. \"Mayele\" etyaka motema na ba-constant oyo ebombami na molongo.",
