      "each_term_is_half_the_previous_the_tot": "Liloba nyonso ezali ndambo ya oyo eleki. Bokutani epusanaka na 1 kasi ekomaka na yango ata mokolo moko te. Oyo ezali molɔngɔ ya geometric ya bozangi-nsuka na liloba ya liboso 1/2 mpe ratio 1/2: S = (1/2) / (1 − 1/2) = 1. Yango wana paradoxe ya bomweli ya Zeno ekoki kosilisama na matematiki.",
      "the_harmonic_series": "Molɔngɔ ya harmonic",
      "even_though_each_term_is_small_the_ser": "Atako liloba nyonso ezali moke, molɔngɔ epanzanaka. Mpo na koleka 100, ozali na mposa ya pene na 1.5 × 10^43 liloba. Oyo elakisamaki na Nicole Oresme na ba-1300 na kosalela bosangisi: 1/3 + 1/4 > 1/4 + 1/4 = 1/2; 1/5+...+1/8 > 4 × 1/8 = 1/2; okoki ntango nyonso koluka 1/2 mosusu ya kobakisa.",
      "farey_sequences": "Ba-séquence ya Farey",
      "check_1_4_and_1_3_4_1_1_3_1_check_2_5_": "Tala 1/4 mpe 1/3: (4)(1) − (1)(3) = 1. Tala 2/5 mpe 1/2: (5)(1) − (2)(2) = 1. Ezaleli oyo esalaka nzete ya Stern-Brocot ya mitango nyonso oyo ezali rationnel.",
      "multiplying_telescopes": "Ba-télescope ya bofuli",
      "rewrite_1_2_2_3_3_4_n_1_n_the_2_in_2_3": "Koma lisusu: 1/2 × 2/3 × 3/4 × ... × (n−1)/n. 2 na 2/3 elongolaka 2 na motango ya nse ya 1/2. 3 na 3/4 elongolaka 3 na motango ya nse ya 2/3. Nyonso elongwaka longola kaka 1/n.",
      "fraction_magic_tricks": "🎩 Mayele ya maji ya eteni",
