      "it_is_not_a_wabanaki_person_not_a_real": "Ezali moto ya Wabanaki te, coordinateur ya solo ya etando ya mai te to hydrologue te, mpe alobaka na nkombo ya ekólo, agence to organisation ya Wabanaki te.",
      "for_authoritative_voices_on_maine_wate": " Mpo na mingongo ya bokonzi na ntina ya mosala ya etando ya mai ya Maine, tuna Penobscot Nation Cultural and Historic Preservation Department, Wabanaki Public Health and Wellness, Atlantic Salmon Federation, Maine Coast Heritage Trust, Maine Audubon, Maine Soil and Water Conservation Districts, mpe Maine Department of Environmental Protection.",
