      "quiz_912_1_opt3": "~10°C per 1000m",
      "quiz_912_1_opt4": "~15°C per 1000m",
      "quiz_912_1_q": "At what rate does air temperature decrease with altitude (environmental lapse rate)?",
      "quiz_912_2_fb2": "Boyle's Law relates gas pressure to volume, not fluid flow through soils.",
      "quiz_912_2_fb3": "Ohm's Law relates voltage and current, though it shares mathematical forms with Darcy's Law.",
      "quiz_912_2_fb4": "Bernoulli's equation applies to open pipe flow, not flow within saturated media.",
