      "audit_paste_it_see_what_breaks": "Audit — kotisa yango, tala nini ekobukana",
      "ai_runs_a_wcag_2_1_aa_pass_against_url": "AI ezali kosala WCAG 2.1 AA pass na input URL / HTML / PDF / screenshot / social / gouvernement. Makambo oyo emonanaka mingi: alt text ezangi (1.1.1), color contrast na nse ya 4.5:1 (1.4.3), keyboard traps (2.1.1), bisika oyo ezangi label (3.3.2).",
      "learn_the_four_pour_principles": "Yekola — mibeko minei ya POUR",
      "perceivable_operable_understandable_ro": "Perceivable, Operable, Understandable, Robust (POUR). Critère ya WCAG nyonso ekokani na moko ya oyo. Bokono ezali bokeseni kati na nzoto mpe environnement, ata moke te ezaleli ya moto.",
      "knowbility_the_field_s_veterans": "Knowbility — bato ya mayele ya domaine",
      "knowbility_austin_tx_est_1999_runs_ope": "Knowbility (Austin, TX, etongamaki 1999) ezali kotambolisa OpenAIR — accessibility hackathon oyo eumeli mingi koleka na mokili — mpe eteyaka ba professionnels na nzela ya AccessU. Bakomaki eteni monene ya buku ya litambwisi oyo auditor nyonso ya sika asalelaka.",
