      "concentrated_hcl_dissolves_skin_on_con": "HCl makasi enyangwaka loposo mbala moko esimbi. Ata ba-asidi oyo ekwei ebimisaka bopeli. Mabɔkɔ na yo ezali pene mingi na bashimi.",
      "a_splash_of_acid_or_base_will_burn_thr": "Mai kopanzana ya asidi to base ekozikisa na bilamba mpe loposo. Kazaka epesaka etando ya libateli oyo bakoki kolongola.",
      "a_dropped_beaker_sends_glass_and_chemi": "Beaker oyo ekwei etindaka talatala mpe bashimi na mabelé mobimba. Sapatɔ oyo efungwami misapi elimboli asidi na makolo ya bolumbu.",
