      "at_half_equivalence_e_equals_e0": "At half-equivalence exactly half the Fe²⁺ has been oxidised, so [Fe³⁺] = [Fe²⁺], the log term in the Nernst equation goes to zero, and the electrode reads E° for the couple itself — the redox twin of pH = pKa.",
