      "why_would_a_heavier_bird_necessarily_n": "Mpo na nini ndɛkɛ ya kilo mingi akosɛnga nguya mingi na km mokomoko — oyo ezali na boyokani nini na bobendi?",
      "a_10_m_s_headwind_doubles_the_work_wha": "Mopɛpɛ ya liboso ya 10 m/s ekómisaka mosala mbala mibale — nini ekosalema soki ndambo ya mobembo ezali na mopɛpɛ ya nsima ya 10 m/s?",
      "why_is_v_formation_savings_about_22_wh": "Mpo na nini libombo ya molɔngɔ V ezali pene ya 22%? Motuya na yango ezali boni mpo na ndɛkɛ oyo azali kokamba?",
      "how_does_a_hummingbird_4_g_1500_km_gul": "Ndenge nini hummingbird (gramu 4, kokatisa Gulf ya Mexico km 1,500) abikaka na mobembo na ye?",
      "i_can_explain_why_this_profile_yields_": "Nakoki kolimbola mpo na nini profile oyo epesaka ezaleli ya nguya oyo.",
      "explain_in_your_own_words": "Limbolá na maloba na yo moko...",
      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Widget ya boluki — banɔti te, bomonisi te, mpela ya biyano te. Modɛlɛ ya nguya ezali ya ndakisa (bobendi ∝ m^0.67 / bonene ya lipapu). Libombo ya molɔngɔ V ekeseni ~10 tii 30% na kotalela lolenge mpe esika (Lissaman & Shollenberger 1970, ndelo ya likoló ya likanisi; bameko na bopimbwi ezali na Weimerskirch et al. 2001 na bapelikã mpe Portugal et al. 2014 na ba-ibis). Widget esalelaka 22% lokola ekamwiseli ya katikati. Mpo na ekolozi ya solo ya bisika ya botelemi, talá mikanda ya ebandeli.",
      "v_formation_flying": "Bopimbwi ya Molɔngɔ V",
      "trailing_birds_catch_the_upwash_from_t": "Bandɛkɛ ya nsima bakangaka mopɛpɛ-likoló ya ndɛkɛ oyo azali liboso — libombo ya nguya 20-30%. Esika ya bokambi ebalukaka mpo ndɛkɛ oyo azali liboso asalaka mosala mingi koleka.",
      "wind_currents_thermals": "Mikɛlɛ ya Mopɛpɛ + Mopɛpɛ ya Molunge",
      "birds_read_pressure_gradients_we_canno": "Bandɛkɛ batangaka ba-gradient ya botindi oyo biso tokoki koyoka te. Mopɛpɛ-likoló, mokɛlɛ ya nsɔngɛ mpe makonzí ya molunge ezali nzela oyo banyama ya boyemi bapimbwaka bakilomɛtɛlɛ nkama batumbaka pene ya kalori zɛro.",
      "migration_routes_flyways": "Banzela ya Mobembo + Banzela ya Bopimbwi",
      "four_major_north_american_flyways_paci": "Banzela minei ya minene ya bopimbwi ya Amerika ya Nɔɔrdi (Pacifique, Katikati, Mississippi, Atlantique) etambwisaka ba-miliaridi ya bandɛkɛ mbala mibale na mbula. Maine ezali na likoló ya nzela ya bopimbwi ya Atlantique.",
      "aerodynamics_of_bird_flight": "Siansi ya Bokɛli ya Mopɛpɛ ya Bopimbwi ya Ndɛkɛ",
      "wing_shape_aspect_ratio_camber_tunes_l": "Lolenge ya lipapu (ekokanisi ya lolenge + bogumbami) ebongisaka bokoli na kotalela bobendi. Bandɛkɛ ya kopimbwa = ekokanisi ya lolenge ya likoló, kobɛta lipapu ya malɛmbɛ. Ba-hummingbird = ekokanisi ya lolenge ya nse, kobɛta lipapu koleka 60 Hz.",
      "weather_navigation": "Ntango + Botambwisi",
      "birds_use_multiple_cues_simultaneously": "Bandɛkɛ basalelaka bilembo ebele na ngonga moko — bousɔlɛ ya moi, elanga ya aiman na nzela ya cryptochrome na liso, ba-modɛlɛ ya minzoto mpe bilembo ya mabelé oyo bayekolaki. Bazali makasi liboso ya kobungisa elembo moko na moko.",
      "v_formation_wind_currents_flyways_aero": "Kopumbwa na 3D - Kokende ya mpungu Monarch - Molongo ya V - Mipepe - Banzela ya kopumbwa - Nguya ya mopepe - Kolakisa nzela",
