      "which_structure_is_most_likely_affecte": "Eloko nini ekoki kozwa likama koleka?",
      "patella_patellofemoral_joint": "Patella / ekangeli patellofemoral",
      "patellofemoral_pain_syndrome_occurs_wh": "Maladi ya mpasi ya patellofemoral esalemaka ntango patella etámbolaka malamu te na nzela na yango likoló ya femur. Botindami ya mbala mingi ya kopota ememaka kotumba ya cartilage. Bosálisi ezali na kolendisa quad, kolendisa loketo, mpe kobongola misala.",
      "the_shoulder_that_won_t_lift": "Lipeka Oyo Ekotombola Te",
      "which_structure_is_most_likely_torn": "Eloko nini ekoki kopaswana koleka?",
      "supraspinatus_tendon_rotator_cuff": "Tendon supraspinatus (rotator cuff)",
      "the_supraspinatus_is_the_most_commonly": "Supraspinatus ezali mosuni ya rotator cuff oyo epaswanaka mingi. Elekaka na nse ya acromion esika ekutanaka na botindami mpe kopaswana. Mosala ya likoló ya motó lokola kopakola langi emataka likama oyo mingi.",
      "racing_heart_after_exercise": "Motema Oyo Ezali Kobɛta Mbangu Nsima ya Ngalasisi",
      "which_structure_controls_the_normal_he": "Eloko nini eyángelaka kobɛta ya motema ya semba?",
      "sinoatrial_sa_node": "Sinoatrial (SA) node",
      "the_sa_node_in_the_right_atrium_is_the": "SA node na atrium ya mobali ezali pacemaker ya bomoto ya motema. Na ntango ya ngalasisi makasi, adrénaline ekoki kosala kobɛta ezali na likama te ntango kobɛta ya motema ebongwani. Ba-arythmie oyo ekobaka esengeli komekama mpo na kolongola maladi ya motema ya bosáleli.",
      "the_numb_hand": "Lobɔkɔ Oyo Ekufi",
      "which_nerve_is_being_compressed": "Misisa nini ezali kokangama?",
      "median_nerve_carpal_tunnel_syndrome": "Misisa median (maladi ya carpal tunnel)",
      "carpal_tunnel_syndrome_is_compression_": "Maladi ya carpal tunnel ezali bokangami ya misisa median na nse ya flexor retinaculum na loketo ya lobɔkɔ. Misisa median epesaka mosapi monene mpe misapi 3.5 ya liboso boyoki. Kosalela loketo ya lobɔkɔ mbala mingi ezali likama monene.",
      "the_swollen_neck_node": "Nkulutu ya Nkingo Oyo Evimbi",
      "what_diagnosis_must_be_urgently_ruled_": "Diagnostic nini esengeli kolongolama nokinoki?",
      "lymphoma_hodgkin_lymphoma": "Lymphome (Hodgkin lymphome)",
      "painless_lymphadenopathy_with_b_sympto": "Kovimba ya bankulutu ya lymph oyo ezali na mpasi te, na bilembo ya B (motoki ya butú, kokita ya kilo, fiévre) ezali elembo ya solo ya Hodgkin lymphome na bilenge. Biopsie oyo elakisi baselili ya Reed-Sternberg endimisaka diagnostic.",
      "the_diabetic_emergency": "Likama ya Nokinoki ya Sukali",
      "which_cells_failed_and_what_is_the_eme": "Baselili nini ekweyi, mpe likama ya nokinoki ezali nini?",
      "beta_cells_of_islets_of_langerhans_dia": "Bacellule beta ya bisanga ya pankreasi; ketoacidose ya diabete (DKA)",
      "without_insulin_from_beta_cells_glucos": "Soki insuline ezali moke mingi, biteni mingi ya nzoto ekoki kosalela glucose lokola esengeli te mpe libale ekobakisa kosala ketone uta na mafuta. Ketone eyingelaka mpe ekómisaka makila acide; kopema makasi ya Kussmaul esalisaka mpo na kokitisa gaz carbonique. DKA ezali likambo ya lombangu ya monganga oyo basalaka na mai, insuline, kotala electrolyte mpe kobongisa oyo ebimisaki yango.",
      "the_broken_collarbone": "Mokuwa ya Lipeka Oyo Ebukani",
      "why_is_the_middle_third_of_the_clavicl": "Mpo na nini eteni ya kati ya clavicule ezali esika oyo ebukanaka mingi?",
      "the_middle_third_is_thinnest_and_has_n": "Eteni ya kati ezali ya moke mpe ezali na bolendisi ya mosuni te",
      "the_clavicle_is_the_most_frequently_fr": "Clavicule ezali mokuwa oyo ebukanaka mbala mingi. Eteni ya kati na yango ezali ya moke mpe ezali na bobateli ya mosuni te. Nguya ya kokweya na lobɔkɔ oyo etandami esanganaka na esika oyo ya bolɛmbu. Mingi ebikaka na kokanga lobɔkɔ.",
      "breathless_at_high_altitude": "Kozanga Mopɛpɛ na Esika ya Likoló",
      "why_does_altitude_cause_these_symptoms": "Mpo na nini bosanda ememaka bilembo oyo, mpe eloko nini ezwaka botindami koleka?",
      "the_alveoli_and_respiratory_muscles_re": "Alveoli mpe misuni ya kopema; oxygène ya mopɛpɛ oyo ekiti ememaka hypoxie",
      "at_high_altitude_atmospheric_pressure_": "Na esika ya likoló, botindami ya mopɛpɛ ekiti, ekitisaka botindami ya eteni ya oxygène. Oxygène moke elekaka na lomposo ya alveoli. Nzoto ezongisaka na kopema mbangu mpe mozindo, ematisaka mosala ya misuni ya kopema.",
