      "arteries_branch_into_arterioles_and_ca": "Misisa ekabwanaka na ba-arteriole mpe ba-capillaire esika O2 mpe bilei epesamaka mpe CO2/bosoto esangisamaka.",
      "venous_return": "Bozongi ya Vena",
