      "pharynx_2": "Mongongo",
      "air_passes_through_the_nasopharynx_and": "Mopɛpɛ elekaka na nasopharynx mpe oropharynx, nzelá oyo ekabolami na nzelá ya bilei.",
      "larynx": "Larynx",
      "air_crosses_the_vocal_cords_in_the_voi": "Mopɛpɛ elekaka bansinga ya mongongo na sanduku ya mongongo. Epiglotte ebatelaka bilei ekɔta na nzelá ya mopɛpɛ te.",
      "trachea_2": "Nzelá ya Mopɛpɛ",
      "the_trachea_windpipe_is_reinforced_by_": "Nzelá ya mopɛpɛ elendisami na bapɛtɛ ya cartilage ya lolenge ya C. Cilia etindaka mucus likoló mpo na kokanga bosoto.",
      "bronchi": "Bronchi",
      "the_trachea_splits_into_left_and_right": "Nzelá ya mopɛpɛ ekabwanaka na bronchi minene ya mwasi mpe ya mobali, mokomoko ekɔtaka na mapumbulu moko. Ekabwanaka na ba-bronchiole ya mike.",
      "alveoli_2": "Alveoli (basaki ya mopɛpɛ)",
      "300_million_grape_like_sacs_where_gas_": "Basaki milio 300 lokola mbuma ya vino esika boyanolani ya gaz esalemaka. O2 epanzanaka na makila; CO2 epanzanaka libándá. Etando ya likoló ekokani na terrain ya tennis.",
      "exhalation": "Kobimisa Mopɛpɛ",
      "the_diaphragm_relaxes_and_rises_reduci": "Diaphragme epɛmaka mpe emataka, ekitisaka bonene ya mapumbulu. Mopɛpɛ oyo etondi na CO2 etindami libándá na nzela moko na ngámbo mosusu.",
      "path_of_food": "Nzelá ya Bilei",
