      "swallowing_pushes_the_bolus_past_the_e": "Komela etindaka bolus koleka epiglotte. Mbonge ya péristaltique etindaka yango na nse ya œsophage ya cm 25 na pene ya sekondi 8.",
      "gastric_acid_ph_1_5_3_5_and_pepsin_bre": "Acide ya libumu (pH 1.5-3.5) mpe pepsine ebukaka ba-protéine. Bonyangwisi ebimisaka chyme na ngonga 2-4.",
      "duodenum": "Duodénum",
