      "jejunum_ileum": "Jéjunum & Iléum",
      "most_nutrient_absorption_occurs_here_v": "Komɛla mingi ya bilei esalemaka awa na nzela ya villi mpe microvilli, ematisaka etando ya likoló mbala 600. Bolai ya mètre 6-7.",
      "water_and_electrolytes_are_reabsorbed_": "Mai mpe ba-électrolyte emɛlami lisusu. Bactéries ya mosopo enyangwisaka fibre oyo etikali, ebimisaka ba-vitamine K mpe B12.",
