      "a_pairs_with_t_2_bonds_g_with_c_3_wats": "A ekangamaka na T (bond 2), G na C (3). Watson + Crick + Franklin (1953) basilisaki lolenge oyo na X-ray crystallography. Lolenge yango emonisi ndenge DNA ekomiselaka yango moko mpe etangamaka.",
