      "point_mutation_one_letter_swapped_inse": "Point mutation — balɛtrɛ moko ebongwani. Insertion/deletion — reading frame ememami, protein mobimba ya nse ebebi. Sickle cell anemia ezali kaka A→T moko — balɛtrɛ moko, bopusi ya bomoi mobimba.",
      "crispr_the_precision_edit": "CRISPR — bobongisi ya sikisiki",
      "bacterial_immune_system_repurposed_cas": "Ebongiseli ya bomikɛngɛli ya bakteri ezongisami mpo na mosala mosusu. Cas9 enzyme + guide RNA = ciza ya molekile. Doudna + Charpentier balongaki Nobel 2020. CRISPR therapy ya liboso (sickle cell) FDA endimaki yango na Disɛmbɛ 2023.",
      "protein_fold_function_malfunction": "Protein — kokanga, mosala, libunga",
      "sequence_determines_structure_determin": "Sequence ekataka structure oyo ekataka mosala. Hemoglobin ememaka O₂, antibody eyebaka, enzyme esalaka catalyze. AlphaFold (2020) esakolaki structure milio 200 — mokakatano ya mbula 50 esilisami na sanza 18.",
      "forensics_str_profiling_dna_evidence": "Siansi ya bosambisi — STR profiling + litatoli ya DNA",
      "codis_uses_20_short_tandem_repeat_str_": "CODIS esalelaka short tandem repeat (STR) loci 20. Likoki ya bokokani ezali moko na kati ya quadrillion soki loci nyonso ekokani. Innocence Project — bitumbu koleka 245 ya libunga elongolamaki na komekama DNA nsima ya bosambisi.",
