      "practice_transcription_translation_mut": "Salá momesano ya transcription, translation, bokaboli ya mutation. AP Bio Big Idea 3.A.1 — DNA (ntango mosusu RNA) ezali moboko ya bopanzani ya sango ya libota. NGSS HS-LS3-1.",
