      "retrieval_practice_gamified_speed_buil": "Momesano ya bozongisi — na lolenge ya lisano. Mbangu esalaka automaticity — soki kotala codon table ekómi na yango moko, working memory na yo ekómi na bonsomi mpo na makanisi ya likolo, lokola kosakola bopusi ya mutation.",
