      "previous_2": "← Ya liboso",
      "print": "🖨 Bimisa",
      "next_11": "Oyo elandi →",
      "all_cards": "Bakarte nyonso:",
      "cards_are_designed_to_be_printed_and_u": "💡 Bakarte esalema mpo na kobima na papier mpe kosalelama mosika na ekran. Manipulatives ya solo ya nzoto ezali kaka koleka oyo ya virtual mpo na K-2 — kinesthetic loop ezali na ntina. ",
      "the_app_gives_you_every_manipulative_o": "App epesaka yo MANIPULATIVE NYONSO na loboko, ata ntango kit ya solo ezali na shambre te.",
      "faq": "❓ FAQ",
      "shortcuts": "⌨ Shortcuts",
      "pitfalls": "⚠ Mitambo",
      "about": "ℹ Na ntina",
      "keyboard_shortcuts": "Keyboard shortcuts:",
      "treating_manipulatives_as_filler_not_i": "Kotala manipulatives lokola \"kotondisa ntango\" ezali koteya te",
      "common_mistake_handing_out_blocks_and_": "Libunga ya momeseno: kokabola blocks mpe kokende. Kozanga koteya polele oyo eKANGISAKA manipulative na symbol, mbala mingi bayekoli basanaka na kisano mpe bayekolaka eloko ya sika te. Ntango nyonso silisa session nyonso ya manipulative na: \"Lakisa ngai na papier oyo osalaki sikoyo.\"",
      "keeping_students_on_the_concrete_stage": "Kobatela bayekoli na etape ya concrete ntango molai mingi",
      "a_4th_grader_who_still_needs_blocks_fo": "Moyekoli ya grade 4 oyo azali kaka NA MPOSA ya blocks mpo na 23 + 47 azali na mokakatano. Blocks ezalaki scaffold; soki elongolami ata mokolo moko te, fluency ekolaka te. Kende na representational (bililingi) na grade 2-3, na abstract (symbols) na grade 3-4. Zonga na concrete kaka mpo na concepts ya sika.",
      "skipping_the_representational_stage": "Kopumbwa etape ya representational",
      "most_rushed_teachers_go_from_blocks_st": "Balakisi mingi ya lombangu bakendaka kobanda na blocks mbala moko na \"sikoyo koma 4 + 5 = 9.\" Yango epumbwaka etape ya iconic (kobenda dots, number lines, arrays). Witzel, Mercer & Miller (2003) bamonaki ete esika oyo epolele te ezali esika bayekoli mingi bakweyaka. Ntango nyonso bakisa etape ya elilingi.",
      "letting_students_always_work_alone": "Kotika bayekoli basala ngonga nyonso bango moko",
      "manipulative_work_without_talk_is_half": "Mosala ya manipulative KOZANGA KOLOBA ezali kati-kati ya valeur na yango. Sangisa bayekoli mibale-mibale; sɛnga bango baloba oyo bazali kosala. Koloba yango EZALI etape ya bolendisi oyo ememaka mosala kobanda na \"misapi eyebi\" tii na \"motó eyebi.\"",
      "confusing_speed_with_understanding": "Kobulunganisa mbangu na bososoli",
      "timed_fact_fluency_drills_can_make_stu": "Drills ya fact-fluency ya ntango ekoki kosala bayekoli bazala mbangu na procedures oyo basosolaka te (tala boluki ya \"math anxiety\": Boaler 2014). Mosala ya manipulative ya malɛmbɛ EZALI na se ya mosala ya papier ya mbangu te mpo na K-3.",
      "mismatching_manipulative_to_standard": "Kobongola te manipulative na standard",
      "don_t_use_the_abacus_to_teach_fraction": "Kosalela abacus te mpo na koteya fractions. Kosalela pattern blocks te mpo na koteya place value. Karte ya Curriculum elakisaka manipulative oyo esalaka na CCSS nini — banda kuna.",
      "praising_effort_but_not_strategy": "Kokumisa milende kasi strategy te",
      "saying_great_job_rewards_completion_sa": "Koloba \"mosala malamu!\" epesaka mbano na bosili. Koloba \"Namoni omeka trapezoids 3 liboso obongoli na triangles 6 — nini esalaki obongola?\" epesaka mbano na makanisi. Zala sikisiki.",
      "ignoring_student_invented_strategies": "Koboya strategies oyo bayekoli babimisi",
      "a_student_who_shows_8_5_as_9_4_because": "Moyekoli oyo alakisi 8 + 5 lokola \"9 + 4\" (mpo azwaki 1 na 5 mpe abakisaki na 8 liboso) abimisi strategy ya make-ten. Bimisa yango; pesa yango nkombo; teya kelasi bameka yango. Nzela ya buku ezali nzela kaka moko ya solo te.",
      "using_too_many_manipulatives_at_once": "Kosalela manipulatives mingi na mbala moko",
      "a_table_covered_in_4_different_manipul": "Mesa oyo etondi na manipulatives 4 ekeseni ezali nzela ya mobulu, ezali differentiation te. Pona MOKO na liteya moko na moko. Ba 11 mosusu na esaleli oyo ezali malamu — mpo na mateya mosusu.",
      "forgetting_to_ask_why": "Kobosana kotuna \"mpo na nini?\"",
      "students_will_arrange_counters_correct": "Bayekoli bakobongisa counters malamu mpo bayebi matambe na motó, kozanga kososola ndimbola. \"Mpo na nini otii 1 na colonne ya batuku?\" esengeli ezala motuna na yo oyo otunaka mingi.",
      "cleaning_up_too_quickly": "Kopetola na mbangu mingi",
      "a_built_construction_is_a_powerful_art": "Botongi oyo etongami ezali eloko ya nguya — tika yango na mesa ntango kelasi ezali kolobela yango. Bomba yango na Bibliotɛkɛ soki ozali na mposa na yango lobi. Kosala te bayekoli babuka botongi oyo bazwaki na mpasi mpo na \"kozala pene mpo na maadi oyo elandi.\"",
      "asking_only_convergent_questions": "Kotuna kaka mituna ya convergent",
      "what_is_4_3_has_one_answer_convergent_": "\"Nini ezali 4 + 3?\" ezali na eyano moko (convergent). \"Lakisa ngai 7 na banzela misato ekeseni\" ezali na mingi (divergent). Prompts ya divergent ebimisaka ndenge bayekoli bakanisaka — oyo ezali assessment ya ntina.",
      "about_math_manipulatives": "Na Ntina ya Bisaleli ya Matematiki",
      "a_virtual_kit_of_12_classic_k_5_math_m": "Kit ya virtual ya manipulatives 12 ya kala ya matematiki ya K-5, na scaffold ya CRA progression, ",
      "a_challenge_bank_a_ccss_standards_brow": "banki ya mikakatano, CCSS standards browser, bibliotɛkɛ ya bakarte ya misala oyo ekoki kobima na papier, na ",
      "a_teacher_dashboard_with_progress_expo": "dashboard ya molakisi na bobimisi bokoli.",
      "built_as_part_of": "Etongami lokola eteni ya ",
      "an_open_source_learning_platform_for_k": ", plateforme ya boyekoli ya open-source mpo na bakelasi ya K-12. ",
