      "warm_lo_fi_keys": "Warm lo-fi keys",
      "barry_harris_1929_2021_codified_bebop_": "Barry Harris (1929-2021) abongisaki harmony ya bebop na système. Système na ye esalelaka 6th chords na esika ya 7ths mpe ebakisaka diminished passing chords kati ya ba degré ya scale mpo na kotambwisa mongongo malamu.",
      "ii_v_i_jazz": "ii-V-I (Jazz)",
      "12_bar_blues": "12-Bar Blues",
      "vi_iv_i_v_emo_alt": "vi-IV-I-V (Emo/Alt)",
      "1st_overtone": "Overtone ya 1",
      "2nd_overtone": "Overtone ya 2",
      "3rd_overtone": "Overtone ya 3",
      "4th_overtone": "Overtone ya 4",
      "5th_overtone": "Overtone ya 5",
      "6th_overtone": "Overtone ya 6",
      "7th_overtone": "Overtone ya 7",
      "attack_time_to_reach_full_volume_decay": "Attack: ntango ya kokóma na volume mobimba. Decay: ntango ya kokita na sustain. Sustain: niveau ya volume oyo esimbami. Release: ntango ya kolimwa nsima ya kotika key.",
      "a_scale_is_an_ordered_set_of_pitches_m": "Scale ezali lisangá ya ba pitch oyo ebongisami. Modes ezali ba rotation ya scale oyo ebandi na ba degré ekeseni. Moko na moko esalaka humeur ya mayoki ekeseni.",
      "chords_are_built_by_stacking_intervals": "Ba chord etongamaka na kotanda ba interval (ba 3rd). Major esalelaka major 3rd + minor 3rd. Minor ebalolaka yango. Extended chords ebakisaka 7ths, 9ths, mpe koleka.",
      "kicks_use_a_sine_oscillator_with_a_pit": "Ba kick esalelaka sine oscillator na pitch sweep. Ba snare esangisaka noise (efiltrami) + tone body. Ba hi-hat esalelaka high-pass filtered noise bursts.",
      "4_4_4_quarter_note_beats_per_bar_most_": "4/4 = ba quarter-note beat 4 na bar moko (oyo eleki komonana). 3/4 = ndenge ya waltz. 6/8 = compound duple. 5/4 na 7/8 esalaka ba groove ya asymétrie, ya bapaya.",
      "keys_arranged_by_ascending_5ths_clockw": "Ba key ebongisami na ba 5th oyo ezali komata na sens ya montre. Ba key ya pembeni ekabolaka ba note 6 na 7. Kokende na sens ya montre ebakisaka ba sharp; contre-sens ebakisaka ba flat.",
      "every_musical_sound_contains_overtones": "Lokito nyonso ya miziki ezali na ba overtone likolo ya fundamental. Makasi na yango relative ekataka timbre — yango wana trompette eyokanaka ndenge mosusu na flûte na pitch moko.",
      "an_interval_is_the_distance_between_tw": "Interval ezali ntaka kati ya ba pitch mibale, oyo emekami na ba semitone. Ratio ya fréquence ekataka consonance (ba ratio ya pete lokola 3:2 eyokanaka malamu).",
      "plays_chord_notes_one_at_a_time_in_seq": "Ebetaka ba note ya chord moko-moko na molongo. Likolo = uta na se tii likolo, Se = uta likolo tii na se. Esalaka ba pattern oyo ezali kotiyola uta na ba chord oyo etélémi.",
      "a_filter_removes_frequencies_above_low": "Filter elongolaka ba fréquence oyo ezali likolo (lowpass), na se (highpass), to zingazinga (bandpass) ya cutoff frequency. Resonance (Q) ebakisaka ba fréquence pene na cutoff, esalaka peak.",
      "tremolo_periodic_volume_changes_amplit": "Tremolo: mbongwana ya volume ya ntango na ntango (amplitude modulation). Vibrato: mbongwana ya pitch ya ntango na ntango (frequency modulation). Nyonso mibale etambwisami na LFO (Low Frequency Oscillator).",
      "discovered_in_1983_a_noise_burst_feeds": "Emonanaki na 1983. Noise burst ekotaka na delay line ya mokuse mpenza oyo ezali na feedback. Delay time ekataka pitch. Filter na kati ya feedback loop etambwisaka pole mpe decay. Emekolaka plucked strings na ndenge ya bomoto.",
      "the_sequencer_is_a_composition_tool_ea": "Sequencer ezali esaleli ya composition. Step moko na moko emonisaka subdivision ya beat. Molongo ya melody etyaka pitched notes, ba drum ebakisaka rythme. Musical notation emonisaka oyo osalaka.",
      "notes_on_lines_and_spaces_represent_pi": "Ba note na ba ligne mpe ba espace emonisaka ba pitch. Durée emonisami na forme ya note: whole (○), half (𝅗𝅥), quarter (♩), eighth (♪). Staff ezali na ba ligne 5.",
