      "equal_temperament_12_notes_per_octave_": "Equal temperament: ba note 12 na octave, ratio 2^(1/12). A4 = 440 Hz; A5 = 880 Hz. Well-Tempered Clavier ya Bach (1722) endimisaki mokili na compromis oyo. Note nyonso oyo obetaka awa ezali na grid wana.",
      "scales_the_major_minor_modal_grammar": "Scales — grammaire major + minor + modal",
      "major_w_w_h_w_w_w_h_minor_w_h_w_w_h_w_": "Major: W-W-H-W-W-W-H. Minor: W-H-W-W-H-W-W. Ba mode 7 (Ionian, Dorian, Phrygian, Lydian, Mixolydian, Aeolian, Locrian) eutaka na kobalola interval pattern ya major scale.",
      "chords_stacked_thirds_inversions": "Chords — ba third etandami + ba inversion",
      "triads_root_third_fifth_major_4_3_semi": "Ba triad: root + third + fifth. Major (4+3 ba semitone), minor (3+4), diminished (3+3), augmented (4+4). Ba 7th chord ebakisaka third mosusu. Miziki pop = ~ba chord 6 oyo ezongelaka; jazz esalelaka ba extension mpe ba substitution.",
      "harmony_pad_voiced_pads_drones": "Harmony Pad — voiced pads + drones",
      "sustained_chord_textures_the_bed_under": "Sustained chord textures — mbeto na se ya pene na score nyonso ya cinéma. Meka iv-V-i na minor, to i-VI-VII mpo na humeur ya Hans Zimmer. Ba drone na ba fifth esimbaka miziki classique ya Inde mpe ba tradition ya bagpipe.",
      "beat_pad_sample_based_drums": "Beat Pad — sample-based drums",
      "most_popular_music_sits_at_4_4_90_130_": "Miziki mingi ya lokumu ezali na 4/4, 90-130 BPM. Hip-hop ~85-95, house 120-130, drum-and-bass ~170 (ndenge ya half-time). Kick na 1+3, snare na 2+4 = backbeat — moboko ya rock + pop.",
      "theory_the_math_behind_the_sound": "Theory — matematiki nsima ya lokito",
      "pythagoras_500_bce_discovered_consonan": "Pythagore (~500 BCE) amonaki consonance uta na ba ratio ya fréquence ya mibalisa: octave 2:1, fifth 3:2, fourth 4:3. Helmholtz apanzaki yango na 1862. Lokito = ba mbonge ya compression; miziki = ba pattern oyo tondimani kobenga kitoko.",
