      "fm_synthesis_2": "FM Synthesis",
      "frequency_modulation_fm_synthesis_uses": "Frequency Modulation (FM) synthesis esalelaka oscillator moko (modulator) mpo na kobongola fréquence ya mosusu (carrier) noki. Ratio modulator:carrier ekataka harmonic content. Ba ratio ya pete (1:1, 2:1, 3:1) esalaka harmonic tones. Ba ratio ya mindondo esalaka metallic, bell-like, to inharmonic sounds. Yamaha DX7 ekomisaki FM lokumu na 1983.",
