      "supersaw_unison": "SuperSaw / Unison",
      "supersaw_stacks_multiple_sawtooth_osci": "SuperSaw etandaka ba sawtooth oscillator ebele oyo edetune moke-moke moko na mosusu. Yango esalaka lokito ya monene, ya monene, oyo ezali kongenga — elembo ya EDM, trance, mpe pop ya sika. Ba voice mingi = ya monene kasi esalelaka CPU mingi. Detuning etambwisaka ndenge ba voice ezali mosika na tuning — detune mingi = ya monene/lokola chorus mingi, moke = ya makasi/ya kotala mingi.",
