      "arpeggiator_gate": "Gate ya arpeggiator",
      "an_arpeggiator_plays_the_notes_of_a_ch": "🔬 Arpeggiator ebetaka ba note ya chord moko-moko na molongo. \"Likolo\" ekendaka uta na se tii likolo, esalaka nguya oyo ezali komata. \"Se\" ekitaka mpo na ndenge ya kokweya ya mai. Mbangu etambwisaka mbangu (moke = noki). Gate etambwisaka boumeli oyo note moko na moko elelaka (100% = legato, 10% = staccato). Meka mbangu=100ms + ba octave 4 + up pattern mpo na classic trance arp!",
      "live_mic_effects_lab": "🎤 Live Mic Effects Lab",
      "sing_speak_or_play_an_instrument_hear_": "Yemba, loba, to beta instrument — yoka effects na temps réel!",
      "monitor_hear_yourself_use_headphones": "🔊 Monitor (yoka yo moko — salela ba casque!)",
