      "removes_frequencies_above_lowpass_or_b": "Elongolaka ba fréquence oyo ezali likolo (lowpass) to na se (highpass) ya seuil. Lokola kofunga monoko na loboko — ba fréquence ya likolo elimwaka, lokito ekomaka \"molili\" mingi.",
      "delay": "Delay",
      "creates_echoes_by_copying_the_signal_a": "Esalaka ba echo na kokopie signal mpe kobeta yango lisusu nsima ya ntango moke. Feedback etambwisaka motango ya ba echo oyo ezongelaka.",
      "reverb_2": "Reverb",
      "simulates_room_acoustics_by_creating_t": "Emekolaka acoustique ya shambre na kosala ba echo mikemike nkoto oyo esanganaka. Shambre moke = reverb ya mokuse, cathédrale = reverb ya molai.",
      "distortion": "Distortion",
      "clips_the_waveform_peaks_turning_smoot": "Ekataka ba peak ya waveform, ebongolaka ba sine wave ya kitoko na ba forme ya makasi, ya ba coin. Yango ebakisaka ba harmonic ya sika oyo ezalaki te na lokito ya ebandeli.",
      "chorus": "Chorus",
      "duplicates_the_signal_with_a_slight_co": "Ekopie signal na delay moke oyo ezali kobongwana ntango nyonso. Yango emekolaka ba voice/instrument ebele oyo ezali kobeta esika moko na botiki moke.",
      "tremolo": "Tremolo",
      "rapidly_varies_the_volume_up_and_down_": "Ebongolaka volume likolo mpe na se noki, esalaka effet ya kobeta. Ezali komonana na guitare surf mpe miziki ya orgue.",
      "use_headphones_when_monitoring_to_avoi": "Salela ba casque tango ozali komonitorer mpo na koboya feedback loops! Mic elekaka na effects nyonso ya likolo (filter, delay, reverb, bnk.) — bongisa yango mpo na koyoka ndenge moko na moko ebongolaka mongongo to instrument na yo.",
      "connect_your_microphone_to_run_your_vo": "Kangisa microphone na yo mpo na kotambwisa mongongo to instrument na yo na effects chain na temps réel.",
      "see_your_voice_as_a_waveform_frequency": "Mona mongongo na yo lokola waveform + frequency spectrum. Yoka ndenge filter, delay, reverb, distortion, mpe chorus ebongolaka sound waves na nzoto.",
