      "xy_pad_performance": "XY Pad Performance",
      "the_xy_pad_maps_your_finger_mouse_posi": "XY pad ekomaka esika ya mosapi/souris na yo na ba paramètre ya miziki na temps réel. X axis etambwisaka pitch (mwasi = se, mobali = likolo). Y axis etambwisaka filter cutoff frequency (likolo = pole, se = molili). Yango ekokani na ba instrument lokola Korg Kaoss Pad, oyo ebongolaki live electronic music performance na kobongola 2D gestures na lokito.",
