      "has_the_tallest_volcano_in_the_solar_s": "Ezali na ngomba ya mɔtɔ ya molai koleka na sistɛmɛ ya moi: Olympus Mons (bosanda km 21.9).",
      "largest_planet_the_great_red_spot_is_a": "Planet ya monene koleka. Litonó Monene ya Motane ezali mbula ya makasi oyo eleki Mabelé na bonene!",
