      "kepler_ii_equal_areas_in_equal_times": "Kepler II — bitando ekokani na ntango ekokani",
      "a_line_from_planet_to_sun_sweeps_equal": "Molɔngɔ oyo euti na planet tii na Moi elekisaka bitando ekokani na ntango ekokani — elakisi ete baplanet etambolaka MBANGU pene na Moi (perihelion) mpe MALƐMBƐ mosika (aphelion).",
      "kepler_iii_period_semi_major_axis": "Kepler III — eleko² ∝ eksi-ya-monene-ya-ndambo³",
      "t_a_when_t_is_in_years_and_a_is_in_au_": "T² = a³ ntango T ezali na bambula mpe a na AU. Mabelé na T=1, a=1 esalaka ete matematiki ezala pɛtɛɛ mpenza. Kobakisa bonene ya orbitɛ mbala mibale ekómisaka eleko mbala ~2.83.",
      "workshop_build_your_own_orbit": "Atelye — tongá orbitɛ na yo moko",
      "set_semi_major_axis_eccentricity_the_o": "Tiá eksi ya monene ya ndambo + ekscentrisite; orrery elakisi orbitɛ na ntango ya solo. Meká e=0.9 — wana ezali mokili ya bakomɛtɛ. Meká e=0 — sɛrklɛ ya kokoka.",
