      "the_minimum_energy_way_to_travel_betwe": "Nzela ya nguya ya moke koleka mpo na kokende longwa na orbitɛ ya sɛrklɛ moko tii na mosusu. Kopela mibale: kolongwa na orbitɛ ya kati na perihelion ya botamboli, kokóma na orbitɛ ya libanda na aphelion.",
