      "the_universe_is_13_8_billion_years_old": "Molɔngɔ ezali na bambula miliare 13.8. Ebandaki na bozindo mpe molunge oyo ezangi ndelo, na nsima epanzanaki mpe ekómaki mpiɔ. Ba-galaksi esalemaki na bambula miliare 1, Moi na biso na bambula miliare 9, mpe tozali awa na bambula miliare 13.8.",
