      "phases_of_venus_galileo": "♀ Bitape ya Venus (Galileo)",
      "galileo_s_1610_observations_venus_goes": "Botali ya Galileo ya 1610: Venus elekaka na bitape. Yango elakisaki ete Venus ebalukaka zingazinga ya Moi, Mabelé te.",
      "earth_9": "Mabelé",
      "venus_3": "Venusi",
      "galileo_s_1610_discovery_venus_has_pha": "Bomoni ya Galileo ya 1610: Venus ezali na bitape lokola Sanza",
      "orbit_2": "Orbitɛ",
      "in_1610_galileo_observed_venus_through": "Na 1610 Galileo atalaki Venus na telɛskɔpɛ na ye mpe amonaki ete elekaka na bitape — lokola Sanza. Yango ezalaki elembo ete Venus ebalukaka zingazinga ya Moi, Mabelé te. Sistɛmɛ ya Ptolémée oyo etyaki Mabelé na katikati ekoki kolimbola te Venus ya kotonda. Elembo ya monene mpo na sistɛmɛ ya Copernic oyo etyaki Moi na katikati.",
      "magnetic_field_visualizer": "🧲 Emonisi ya Elanga ya Magnetiki",
      "a_magnetic_field_deflects_solar_wind_p": "Elanga ya magnetiki ebendaka mosika mopɛpɛ ya moi + ebatelaka atmosfɛrɛ. Mars ebungisaki nyonso mibale; yango wana ezali esobe.",
      "earth_10": "Mabelé",
      "magnetic_field_3": "Elanga ya magnetiki",
      "solar_wind_2": "Mopɛpɛ ya moi",
      "earth_s_magnetic_field_deflects_most_s": "Elanga ya magnetiki ya Mabelé ebendaka mosika mopɛpɛ mingi ya moi, mpe ebatelaka atmosfɛrɛ + bomoi. Mars ebungisaki elanga na yango ya magnetiki eleki ~bambula miliare 4 mpe ebungisaki malɛmbɛ atmosfɛrɛ na yango. Jupiter ezali na elanga ya makasi koleka na sistɛmɛ ya moi.",
      "solar_system_scale": "📐 Ndenge ya Bonene ya Sistɛmɛ ya Moi",
      "switch_between_size_and_distance_views": "Bongolá na kati ya bomoni ya bonene mpe ya ntaka. Nyonso mibale ekoki kolakisama na ndenge ya solo mbala moko te — yango elakisi ndenge espasi ezali mpenza mpamba.",
