      "previous_4": "← Oyo eleki",
      "next_6": "Oyo elandi →",
      "tonight_sky_observing_guide": "🔭 Motambwisi ya Kotala Likolo Lelo na Butu",
      "10_things_you_can_spot_tonight_with_ju": "Biloko 10 oyo okoki komona lelo na butu kaka na miso na yo to na longue-vue.",
      "best_naked_eye_observing_dark_site_awa": "Kotala malamu na miso mpamba: esika ya molili (mosika na miinda ya engumba), Sanza na nse ya horizon, miso emeseni na molili (miniti 20-30 na molili). Ba-app ya ofele: Stellarium, SkyView, Star Walk esalisaka koyeba oyo ozali komona.",
      "pale_blue_dot": "🌍 Litonó ya Bulé ya Bolɛmbu",
      "carl_sagan_s_most_quoted_reflection_a_": "Makanisi ya Carl Sagan oyo bazongelaka mingi koleka. Pixel moko oyo ezali na bato nyonso oyo toyebaki.",
      "the_pale_blue_dot": "Litonó ya Bulé ya Bolɛmbu",
      "from_this_distant_vantage_point_the_ea": "« Longwa na esika oyo ya mosika, Mabelé ekoki komonana lokola ezali na ntina te. Kasi mpo na biso, ezali ndenge mosusu. Talá lisusu litonó wana. Ezali awa. Ezali ndako. Ezali biso. Likolo na yango, moto nyonso oyo olingaka, moto nyonso oyo oyebi, moto nyonso oyo oyokaki nsango na ye, moto nyonso ya bomoto oyo azalaki, alekisaki bomoi na ye. »",
      "carl_sagan_pale_blue_dot_1994": "— Carl Sagan, Pale Blue Dot (1994)",
      "voyager_1_took_this_photo_of_earth_fro": "Voyager 1 ekamataki foto oyo ya Mabelé longwa na ntaka ya km miliare 6 na 14 Febwali 1990 — na bosɛngi ya Carl Sagan. Mabelé ezali kaka pixel moko. Moto nyonso na lisolo ya bato afandaki na pixel wana.",
      "famous_nebulae": "☁ Ba-nebilɛzɛ Oyo Eyebani Mingi",
      "8_iconic_deep_sky_objects_star_nurseri": "Biloko 8 ya bozindo ya likolo oyo eyebani. Bandako ya bobotami ya minzoto, mposo ya minzoto oyo ezali kokufa, biteni ya ba-supernova.",
