      "stereogram": "Stereogram",
      "hidden_3d_images_magic_eye_style": "Bililingi ya 3D ebombami (lolenge ya Magic Eye)",
      "harmony": "Boyokani",
      "harmony_desc": "Luka boyokani ya miziki, bokeseni ya mingongo, mpe boyokani kati ya mongongo mpe elilingi",
      "contrast": "Bokeseni",
      "wcag_contrast_checker_for_accessibilit": "Etalisi ya bokeseni ya WCAG mpo na bozwi ya bato nyonso",
      "educational_concepts": "💡 Makanisi ya Boyekoli",
      "color_theory_additive_vs_subtractive_m": "Teori ya lángi (bosangisi ya bobakisi na oyo ya bolongoli, lángi ya bokokisi, HSL/RGB), bagbɛ ya matematiki (hypotrochoids, Lissajous), fractals mpe bokokani na yango moko, jeometri ya karo, bososoli ya miso na Op Art, mibeko ya bozwi ya WCAG, mpe arts ya ordinatɛrɛ. Esaleli mokomoko eteyaka matematiki oyo ezali nsima ya kitoko yango.",
      "got_it_let_s_create": "Nasosoli — tokela! 🎨",
      "art_studio_sections": "Biteni ya Studio ya Arts",
      "color_wheel_2": "Lopɛtɛ ya Lángi",
      "color_mixer_2": "Mosangisi ya Lángi",
      "pixel_art_2": "Arts ya Pixel",
      "symmetry_2": "Bokokani",
      "spirograph_2": "Spirograph",
      "generative_2": "Bokeli",
      "spin_art_2": "Arts ya Kobaluka",
      "string_art_2": "Arts ya Nsinga",
      "op_art_2": "Op Art",
      "tessellation_2": "Karo",
      "fractals_2": "Ba-fractale",
      "gradient_2": "Gradient",
      "stereogram_2": "Stereogram",
      "sculpt_3d": "Kata 3D",
      "contrast_2": "Bokeseni",
      "color_wheel_hsl_hsv_complementary_pair": "Lopɛtɛ ya Lángi — HSL/HSV + babale ya bokokisi",
      "hue_0_360_around_the_wheel_saturation_": "Hue (0-360 zingazinga ya lopɛtɛ), saturation (bopɛto), pole. Ya bokokisi ezali etalani, ya penepene ezali bazalani, misato ezali na ntaka ya 120°. Newton atiaki spɛktrɛ na lopɛtɛ na mobu 1666.",
      "color_mixer_subtractive_vs_additive": "Mosangisi ya Lángi — bolongoli na bobakisi",
      "paint_and_print_subtractive_cmy_mixes_": "Lángi mpe bobimisi na papye = bolongoli (CMY esangani ekokoma molili); pole mpe ekrán = bobakisi (RGB esangani ekokoma mpɛmbɛ). Mokili moko, kasi matematiki ekeseni mpenza — masini ya kobimisa papye ekanisaka na baplaki ya K, televizyo ekanisaka na Hz.",
      "pixel_art_bitmap_craft_at_8_8_to_32_32": "Arts ya Pixel — mosala ya bitmap banda 8×8 kino 32×32",
      "each_pixel_is_a_deliberate_decision_ne": "Pixel mokomoko ezali ekateli oyo ezwami na nkó. Basprite ya NES eyebani mpo na kotia elombe na kati ya 16×16 na palɛti ya lángi 4. Algoritime ya molɔngɔ ya Bresenham edesinaka milɔngɔ ya nkɔngɔ kozanga mituya ya batiki.",
      "symmetry_reflection_rotation_glide": "Bokokani — talatala, bobaluki, bosɛlɛmɛ",
      "bilateral_mirror_rotational_n_fold_poi": "Ya bangámbo mibale (talatala), ya bobaluki (mbala n), ya esika. Bituluku 17 ya mitindo ya efelo ekabolaka motindo nyonso ya 2D oyo ezongelaka — mosala mobimba ya Escher.",
      "spirograph_hypotrochoid_roulettes": "Spirograph — bagbɛ ya hypotrochoid",
      "a_small_circle_rolls_inside_a_big_one_": "Sɛrklɛ ya moke ebalukaka na kati ya oyo ya monene, mpe ekomeli ezali mosika na katikati. Boyokani ya barayɔ mibale ezali kokata motango ya bafololo; ntaka ezali kokata bonene. Elakiseli yango ezwaki patɛnti na 1965, kasi matematiki na yango eutá na bambula 1700.",
      "generative_algorithm_randomness_as_art": "Bokeli — algoritime + likambo ya mbalakaka lokola moyemi",
      "sol_lewitt_wrote_instructions_the_wall": "Sol LeWitt akomaki malako; moto oyo asalaki na efelo azalaki mokokisi. Lelo: Processing, p5.js, Cinder. “Moyemi azali mobeko, ezali te mbano.”",
      "spin_art_centripetal_physics_in_paint": "Arts ya Kobaluka — fizikɛ ya nguya ya kobenda na katikati kati ya lángi",
      "drop_paint_spin_watch_it_fling_outward": "Tia lángi, baluka, mpe talá ndenge ekopanzana libanda na lolenge ya bobaluki. Damien Hirst azwaki bamilio na koteka bililingi ya bobaluki. Fizikɛ se moko lokola masini ya kokawusa salade; F = mω²r.",
      "string_art_curves_from_straight_lines": "Arts ya Nsinga — bagbɛ euti na milɔngɔ ya semba",
      "connect_every_n_th_nail_an_envelope_cu": "Kangisa klu nyonso ya n; gbɛ ya anvelɔpɛ ekobima. Mary Everest Boole ayaki na yango lokola matematiki ya kelasi pene na mobu 1900. Kardyoyidɛ oyo esalemi na milɔngɔ ya semba ezali kaka kokamwisa.",
      "op_art_fooling_the_visual_system": "Op Art — kokosa sistemɛ ya komona",
      "bridget_riley_s_moir_fields_vasarely_s": "Bilanga ya moiré ya Bridget Riley, ba grid ya Vasarely. Basɛlile ya nsɔngɛ ya bɔɔngɔ oyo emonaka bomiyoli ebɛtaka koleka ndelo ntango bokeseni ebongwanaka nokinoki — lokasa emonanaka lokola ezali *koningana*.",
      "tessellation_the_17_wallpaper_groups": "Karo — bituluku 17 ya mitindo ya efelo",
      "every_periodic_2d_tiling_fits_one_of_1": "Karo nyonso ya 2D oyo ezongelaka ekɔtaka na moko ya bituluku 17 ya bokokani. Escher ayebaki yango ntango akendaki na Alhambra na 1936; na nsima alekisaki bambula 30 mpo na kosilisa katalogi yango.",
      "fractal_self_similar_at_every_scale": "Fractal — ekokani na yango moko na etape nyonso",
      "mandelbrot_1975_cauliflower_coastlines": "Mandelbrot 1975. Shufulɛ, libongo ya mbú, mitalaka ya makila, nkake, basaki ya mopɛpɛ ya bapulumo — nyonso ezali fractal. “Mapata ezali babale te, bangomba ezali bakonɛ te, mposo ya nzete ezali pɛtɛɛ mpe te.”",
      "gradient_smooth_color_transitions": "Gradient — mbongwana ya lángi ya pɛtɛɛ",
      "css_gives_you_linear_radial_and_conic_": "CSS epesaka yo gradient ya molɔngɔ, ya sɛrklɛ, mpe ya conic. Monama ya solo ezali na spɛktrɛ oyo ekobaka (milɔngɔ ekabwani te) — “lángi 7 ya monama” ezalaki bobele boponi ya Newton mpo na ntina ya miziki.",
      "stereogram_3d_from_a_flat_page": "Stereogram — 3D euti na lokasa ya patatalu",
      "90s_magic_eye_craze_each_eye_sees_a_sl": "Mposa makasi ya Magic Eye ya bambula 90. Liso mokomoko emonaka elilingi oyo ebongwani mwa moke; soki okatisi to okabola miso na yo malamu, bɔɔngɔ na yo ekosangisa yango mpo ekóma bozindo. Pene na 5% ya bato bakokaka mpenza te — ezali mbeba na bango te.",
      "contrast_wcag_4_5_1_3_1_apca": "Bokeseni — WCAG 4.5:1 / 3:1 / APCA",
      "wcag_2_1_normal_text_4_5_1_large_3_1_w": "WCAG 2.1: makomi ya momeseno 4.5:1, ya minene 3:1. Ntina nini bokeseni ya moke esalaka mabe na batangi oyo bamonaka malamu te, ata soki yo okoki kotanga yango. APCA (mokitani ya WCAG 3.0) esalelaka pole ya bososoli, kasi boyokani ya pole ya mpamba te.",
      "harmony_lab_title": "Boyokani - mongongo, boyokani, mpe lángi",
      "harmony_lab_hint": "Kokanisa bokeseni ya mingongo oyo eyokani mpe oyo eyokani te, kangisa boyokani ya bafrekansi na motindo, mpe balola boyokani ya miziki na boyokani ya miso.",
