      "cultural_connections": "Boyokani ya bonkɔkɔ:",
      "islamic_geometric_art_uses_radial_symm": " Arts ya jeometri ya Islamu esalelaka mingi bokokani ya sɛrklɛ. Bakɔnɔ ya Selti, bilamba ya Navajo, mpe bilembo ya mabota ya Zapɔ (“mon”) nyonso ememeli na bokokani ya bobaluki.",
