      "part_grid_desc": "Stainless bars. In this simulation the floor is only a floor: it delivers nothing. Historically, grid floors were also used to deliver shock, which is a large part of why the chamber carries the reputation it does.",
      "part_hopper": "Food magazine",
      "part_hopper_desc": "Delivers one pellet at a time into the trough. The delivery is the reinforcer only if it actually raises the future rate of the behaviour it followed — a consequence is not a reinforcer by intention.",
