      "maine_has_8_bat_species_the_little_bro": "Maine has 8 bat species. The little brown bat, once our most common species, has declined 90% due to white-nose syndrome. Big brown bats and hoary bats can still be spotted in Maine. If you see a bat flying at dusk, count yourself lucky — and know that single bat might eat 1,000 mosquitoes tonight!",
