      "linotype_the_film_2012_on_streaming_co": "\"Linotype: The Film\" (2012, on streaming) covers the Mergenthaler Linotype, the machine that changed newspapers for 80 years. Wonderfully nerdy. The machines still run at hobbyist shops.",
      "linseed_boiled_slowly_for_hours_become": "Linseed boiled slowly for hours becomes a sticky varnish. This is the breakthrough. It holds the pigment, clings to metal, and oxidizes to dry on paper instead of soaking through.",
