      "pulp_fiction_era": "Pulp Fiction Era",
      "punch": "Punch",
      "punch_matrix_cast_the_three_step_proce": "Punch → matrix → cast. The three-step process that made identical reusable type possible. Type-metal alloy: lead + tin + antimony, and why each.",
      "punk_zines": "Punk zines",
      "pure_white_linen_rags_bedsheets_shirts": "Pure white linen rags — bedsheets, shirts. Best fiber, highest yield, premium paper.",
      "puritan_reformer_sermons": "Puritan + Reformer sermons",
